  "statSections": [
    {
      "name": "Actions",
      "rulesText": "Multiattack. The pirate makes two Dagger attacks. It can replace one attack with a use of Enthralling Panache.\n\nDagger. Melee or Ranged Attack Roll: +5, reach 5 ft. or range 20/60 ft. Hit: 5 (1d4 + 3) Piercing damage.\n\nEnthralling Panache. Wisdom Saving Throw: DC 12, one creature the pirate can see within 30 feet. Failure: The target has the Charmed condition until the start of the pirate's next turn."
    }
